  "faq.1.question": "What are DanaBus main features?",
  "faq.1.answer": "DanaBus helps you look up bus routes, find the fastest path, track buses in real time, buy and pay for tickets, get news alerts, and manage payment methods in the app.",
  "faq.2.question": "How do I find the fastest bus route?",
  "faq.2.answer": "On Home, enter origin and destination then tap Search. The system suggests matching routes with estimated times so you can pick the fastest one.",
  "faq.3.question": "How do I pay for tickets in the app?",
  "faq.3.answer": "Go to Payment to add a method (e-wallet or card). When buying a ticket, choose a linked method and confirm to finish.",
  "faq.4.question": "Which bus routes are most popular in Da Nang?",
  "faq.4.answer": "Central routes and lines linking dense areas are used most. You can see popular suggestions on Home and in News.",
  "faq.5.question": "Does DanaBus support English?",
  "faq.5.answer": "Yes. Change language in Account → Language to use Vietnamese or English.",
  "faq.6.question": "How do I send feedback on DanaBus?",
  "faq.6.answer": "Open Help Center or Reviews on Home to send feedback. You can also contact support via details shown in the app.",
  "faq.7.question": "Does DanaBus support QR for monthly tickets?",
  "faq.7.answer": "Yes. After registering a monthly ticket, use the in-app QR to validate boarding as instructed by the operator.",
  "faq.8.question": "Can I bring pets on the bus?",
  "faq.8.answer": "Pet rules depend on each operator. Please check the policy before boarding or contact support for advice.",
  "faq.9.question": "How do I recover items left on the bus?",
  "faq.9.answer": "Note the route number, plate (if any), and trip time, then contact DanaBus support or the operator to help locate lost items.",
  "faq.10.question": "Who is DanaBus for?",
  "faq.10.answer": "DanaBus serves public bus passengers in Da Nang, including students, workers, and travelers who need route lookup and easy ticket payment.",
